{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4790": "JUNA: 差不多能出发了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4791": "ALEXANDRA: 应该吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4792": "ALEXANDRA: 还得走几天，才能到……我们要去的地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4793": "JUNA: 没记错的话，接下来应该好走些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4794": "JUNA: 越往东南，树林就越少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4795": "ALEXANDRA: 我们在找什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4796": "JUNA: 一场永不停歇的小雨。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-chapter5Start-4797": "JUNA: 走吧，见到了就知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4798": "MAN: 老兄，往上游只有这一条船，价钱就是这个价钱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4799": "BEN: 我很有烦恼！价钱，总是不能说定！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4800": "BEN: 阿伽塔在哪里！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4801": "AGATA: 你在做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4802": "BEN: 谈那个价钱，是哪一个词？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4803": "AGATA: 是“议价”。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4804": "AGATA: 还有，别喊了，大声不代表说得清楚，你太引人注目了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4805": "BEN: 我直接去船长。把问题解决。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4806": "AGATA: 你的杰兰德语还没好到能跟人议价。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4807": "BEN: 我做比划，用……这些叫作什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4808": "AGATA: 你的手？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4809": "BEN: 对，我使用手。金钱是世界通用的语言。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4810": "AGATA: 你怎么学会了“世界通用的语言”，却没学会“手”？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4811": "BEN: 谈话里面，没有发生这个词。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4812": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……您好。他是法师吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4813": "AGATA: 你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4814": "ALEXANDRA: 我叫亚历珊德拉，来自……呃，很远的地方。我需要找个法师帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4815": "ALEXANDRA: 我身上有这个印记。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4816": "AGATA: 等等，你从西北那座城市来，而且也是法师？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4817": "ALEXANDRA: 您怎么……一看就知道别人是……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4818": "AGATA: 你的口音说明了来处。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4819": "AGATA: 而且，这种印记只会由法师施在另一位法师身上，通常是为了标记犯了轻罪的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4820": "ALEXANDRA: 我没有……我是说……不是魔法那种……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4821": "AGATA: 本也许能帮上忙，他这人总会冒出些意想不到的本事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-alexMeetsBen-4822": "AGATA: 趁他还没闹出更大的动静，我们去码头找他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4823": "BEN: 我已经把价钱议好了。不用你的谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4824": "CAPTAIN: 我实在看不下去他这么丢人，才松了口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4825": "AGATA: 你就不能说堤刻语吗？这儿一半人都听得懂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4826": "BEN: 不要。做更多的 technein，是调好酱唯一的办法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4827": "DARIO: 就知道找你们不难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4828": "AGATA: 达里奥！？你来做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4829": "DARIO: 你说呢？把他交出来，我就走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4830": "AGATA: 凭什么？他在这里危及一群野蛮人，学院也要管？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4831": "DARIO: 所以，你承认他很危险？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4832": "AGATA: 他还有很多要学，但并不危险。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4833": "BEN: 把话的速度放下来，我不能明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4834": "AGATA: 走吧，我保证以后你再也见不到他，也听不到他的消息。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4835": "DARIO: 理事会要他回去，没得商量。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4836": "DARIO: 还有……这是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4837": "DARIO: 法师的印记……你是逃犯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4838": "ALEXANDRA: 不是，我根本没去过你们那里！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4839": "DARIO: 这个月最好给我多发点钱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4840": "DARIO: 这事没完。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4841": "AGATA: 再问一次，你是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4842": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，亚历，我说过了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4843": "AGATA: 我问的不是名字。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4844": "JUNA: 我们帮了忙，你多少也该道个谢吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4845": "BEN: 河里的马，怎么会说话？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4846": "AGATA: 好，谢谢，现在能说说你们的来历了吗？刚才是土系魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4847": "JUNA: 对啊，挺厉害吧？不过，既然帮了你们，我们也想请你们帮个忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4848": "AGATA: 已经……很久没有活着的土系法师了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4849": "BEN: 别的人，都不看见这河里的马在说话？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4850": "AGATA: 能解除她身上的法术吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4851": "BEN: 也许。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4852": "JUNA: 他……有这本事吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4853": "AGATA: 他很有魔法天赋，只是没受过正规训练。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4854": "AGATA: 我知道他杰兰德语说得不好，可他也才学了几个星期。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4855": "BEN: 我不能解决。这是高手所做的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4856": "ALEXANDRA: 还有别的人能问问吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4857": "AGATA: 你想进城求助本来就很困难，就算进去了，等着你的麻烦只会更多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4858": "ALEXANDRA: 我根本不想要魔法！能把它弄掉吗？这样印记会不会消失？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4859": "AGATA: 如果你真这么想，有个人也许能帮你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4860": "AGATA: 跟我们一起沿河往上走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4861": "ALEXANDRA: 还要去更远的地方……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4862": "JUNA: 我知道他们要去哪儿，就在我以前常活动的地方旁边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-darioEncounter-4863": "JUNA: 不会有事的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-goUpRiver-4864": "CAPTAIN: 秋雨到来之前，我们不再往上游跑了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-goUpRiver-4865": "CAPTAIN: 准备好去上游了吗？那边没什么东西，行李现在就备齐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-goUpRiver-4866": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-goUpRiver-4867": "CAPTAIN: 好，准备好了告诉我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-goUpRiver-4868": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-goUpRiver-4869": "CAPTAIN: 上船吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-upRiverGrasslands-4870": "CAPTAIN: 这个时节水位太低，开不到修道院，我只能送到这里了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-upRiverGrasslands-4871": "JUNA: 没关系，从这里起，我认识路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-upRiverGrasslands-4872": "JUNA: 西边有个渡河处，过了河，往北去修道院就好走了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-upRiverGrasslands-4873": "JUNA: 要是我的族群不在这里……最难走的就是前面这一段。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsBoatMan-4874": "CAPTAIN: 想回镇上？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsBoatMan-4875": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsBoatMan-4876": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsBoatMan-4877": "CAPTAIN: 好嘞。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4878": "JUNA: 天晚了，夜里穿山谷也走不了多远。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4879": "ALEXANDRA: （我真受够睡在野外了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4880": "BEN: 已经，是做好了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4881": "BEN: 给你们吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4882": "ALEXANDRA: 这……是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4883": "AGATA: 他每天晚上做的都不一样。不过我保证，一定好吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4884": "ALEXANDRA: 好，呃……谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4885": "ALEXANDRA: 真的……很好吃。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4886": "ALEXANDRA: （我还以为，这人早上连穿裤子都得费点劲……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4887": "JUNA: 我，呃……马上回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4888": "AGATA: 你从西边那座大城市来，经过了风之门？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4889": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……对？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4890": "AGATA: 这些年来，守护者团从走陆路的商人那里收集了不少消息。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4891": "AGATA: 可那些消息里，从没有人提到过土系魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4892": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯，呃……我也不知道。有一副魔法牌，还有个幽灵还是什么的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4893": "ALEXANDRA: 后来一只大鸟弄了个风……那种东西……然后我就有魔法了。我也不明白为什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4894": "AGATA: 这消息传回阿科斯，可能会引起轰动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasslandsCampfire-4895": "ALEXANDRA: 我去看看朱娜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasscampBlocker1-4896": "ALEXANDRA: （夜里不能一个人乱跑……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grasscampBlocker2-4897": "ALEXANDRA: （夜里不能一个人乱跑……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4898": "ALEXANDRA: 你还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4899": "JUNA: 嗯，也许吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4900": "JUNA: 我们族群常来这处水潭。至少，以前是常来的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4901": "JUNA: 我们还会唱一首关于这棵树的歌。也可能唱的是它的祖先……毕竟谁也说不准，是不是同一棵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4902": "JUNA: 很久以前的一个夜晚，族群就在这里，一道闪电劈中了这棵树。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4903": "JUNA: 树干里冒出一团球状闪电，从大家头顶飘过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4904": "JUNA: 它炸成一片火花。从那以后，我们就能用魔法了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4905": "ALEXANDRA: 这是真事吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4906": "JUNA: 我也不知道真假。可这里对我们来说，几乎就是圣地，如今却连同族的踪影都找不到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junasHerd-4907": "JUNA: 总之，我在这里待一会儿就好。我没事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-junaAlone-4908": "JUNA: 我在这里待一会儿就好。我没事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostLeft-4909": "ALEXANDRA: 好疼……那个印记……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostLeft-4910": "ALEXANDRA: 不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostLeft-4911": "AGATA: 那是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostLeft-4912": "ALEXANDRA: 我……其实也不知道。就是给我留下印记的那个人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostLeft-4913": "AGATA: 他应该知道我是做什么的，或许会有所顾忌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostLeft-4914": "AGATA: 不过，再感到他的魔法，马上告诉我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostRight-4915": "ALEXANDRA: 好疼……那个印记……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostRight-4916": "ALEXANDRA: 不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostRight-4917": "AGATA: 那是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostRight-4918": "ALEXANDRA: 我……其实也不知道。就是给我留下印记的那个人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostRight-4919": "AGATA: 他应该知道我是做什么的，或许会有所顾忌。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassGhostRight-4920": "AGATA: 不过，再感到他的魔法，马上告诉我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-agataWateringHole-4921": "AGATA: 应该快到修道院了。我其实也从没来过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-benWateringHole-4922": "BEN: 水里的马在拉 skata，我们不是在风的下面吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassCampScene2-4923": "JUNA: 一直往北走，就是修道院。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-grassCampScene2-4924": "JUNA: 天气这么好，用不了多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-windGateRemark-4925": "JUNA: 这个，我永远也习惯不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/toMerdoyo.yarn-windGateRemark-4926": "ALEXANDRA: 真……奇怪。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-siopeIntro-5022": "BEN: 我要去，找卡珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-siopeIntro-5023": "JUNA: 他没问题吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-siopeIntro-5024": "AGATA: 他其实没看起来那么糊涂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-siopeIntro-5025": "AGATA: 当然，也称不上聪明绝顶，不过……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-siopeIntro-5026": "AGATA: 总之，要是你想摆脱自己的力量，这里有人能帮忙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-siopeIntro-5027": "AGATA: 那人叫科尔丁，虽然我没见过他，但他应该认得出守护者。我的身份也许能让事情好办一些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5028": "KORDYNE: 几位是？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5029": "AGATA: 我是守护者团的阿伽塔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5030": "KORDYNE: 看得出来，不过这位被送来，年纪可大了些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5031": "KORDYNE: 还是说，想成为缄默者的是那位尤鲁兽？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5032": "JUNA: 那得看情况，这些麦田能让我吃吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5033": "KORDYNE: 那就只剩这位小姐了，可奇怪的是……我听不见风穿过你的声音。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5034": "ALEXANDRA: 因为……我是说，呃，抱歉，我叫亚历珊德拉，不过，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5035": "AGATA: 她是土系法师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5036": "KORDYNE: 你说她是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5037": "KORDYNE: 而你想摆脱这份力量？要知道，这不是诅咒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5038": "ALEXANDRA: 呃，也算是吧，不是说魔法本身，可我手上有这个印记。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5039": "KORDYNE: 啊，那有人盯上你也不奇怪，你可真是个稀罕人物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5040": "ALEXANDRA: 他……情况很糟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5041": "KORDYNE: 你可以成为缄默者，这样其他法师肯定就对你失去兴趣了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5042": "KORDYNE: 这里也很清静，可以安然度过余生。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5043": "ALEXANDRA: 不，我只是想去掉魔法，再回家去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5044": "KORDYNE: 嗯？没那么简单，小姐，第一次举行仪式，效果有时维持不了多久，你的魔法还会回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5045": "KORDYNE: 而且就算成功了，你也很难再回到从前的生活，别人会奇怪你怎么再也不能说话了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5046": "ALEXANDRA: 等等，什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5047": "KORDYNE: 小姐，“缄默者”可不是随便起的名字，成为缄默者之后，就再也不能开口说话了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5048": "KORDYNE: 仪式之后连手语也用不了，这就是切断你与魔法联系的方式之一。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5049": "ALEXANDRA: 我……不知道还有这个代价。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5050": "KORDYNE: 想清楚再来吧，我们一直在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-meetKordyne-5051": "AGATA: 一直没听见本闹腾，我反而有些担心，去找他吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5052": "BEN: 没有一个人知道，卡珊德拉在哪里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5053": "BEN: 问题是简单的，可是他们还做不到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5054": "ALEXANDRA: 大家要去哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5055": "WOMAN: 尼巴罗斯山的影子就要掠过遗迹了，那些幻影般的人很快就会出现。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5056": "ALEXANDRA: 幻影般的人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5057": "ALEXANDRA: 呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5058": "JUNA: 这……有点让人不安。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5059": "AGATA: 尼巴罗斯山在北边，足足要走两星期……山影竟能投到这么远，实在惊人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5060": "ALEXANDRA: 哇！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5061": "BEN: 只是，那些幻象。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5062": "ALEXANDRA: 他们是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5063": "JUNA: 他们到底在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5064": "AGATA: 那些士兵的军服……我认得，那个法师实验室里的传送门另一边，就有人穿着同样的衣服。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5065": "BEN: 对，是一样的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-nibarosShadowStart-5066": "AGATA: 我想再跟科尔丁谈谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-cantLeaveMonastery-5067": "AGATA: 先找科尔丁谈过，再做别的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-seeEthos1-5068": "AGATA: 什么……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-seeEthos1-5069": "ALEXANDRA: 他们是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-chapter5End-5070": "要保存游戏吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-chapter5End-5071": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-chapter5End-5072": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter5/siopeMonastery.yarn-kordyneDialogue-5073": "KORDYNE: 想清楚再来吧，我们一直在这里。"
}
